{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"868869546004582460","content":"Finn starts looking to Vivvy and talking *real* fast.\n\"Okay sooo, I may have had a problem with secret admirers with all this. I usually have Bowen, Marcos, and Julie work on this all the time. They sift through the messages, hand me the gifts, I enjoy them, end of story. Sometimes I decide to answer my fans. There was this one time, I had one fan send me a trip to Fiji. To Fiji! They had little Tatankan Hula Dancer Bobble heads! I mean who can turn that down!\"\n\nHe sees Vivvy is clearly displeased still\n\"Right so there was this fan, the secret admirer, I guess known as Maud, they gave me the trip to Fiji on a Yacht for a price. I had to agree that they would be my number one fan for all time. Welllll Of course I agreed, easy done, who's going to actually judge that sort of thing. Well whoo boy I didn't know that they had a Fey Arbiter there ready to record this spoken 'contract' and now I guess I'm in violation since you're now becoming..my..biggest...fan?\"\n\nHis voice gets noticeably higher by the end of that sentence.\n\n\"Anyways, I messed up. I'm sorry, and I don't have a bomb that can magically fix this. I love you Vivvy and I'm pretty sure it means we have to end this together and with violence and you have to beat them.  I mean, we have to do it together and also make sure the ritual goes through, but yeah, Maud needs to go. Let's grab whatever we have around us and go out there with a bang!\"\n\nHis hand darts up from under the table curtain and grabbies around. His hand settles on a.... .... ***Potato-tini cup*** and wields it courageously.","created_at":"2021-08-24T05:46:49.455000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879602630991679518","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
